ource src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/9dd542030d88f55307f7aa8ab0ebf114.webm?t=1743152505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/9dd542030d88f55307f7aa8ab0ebf114.mp4?t=1743152505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/96c96be5dfe2c2311bb60f33adeccfc1.avif?t=1743152505\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's 2D backgrounds, terrifying creatures that scurry around, enemies that suddenly appear from behind, and eerie voices and sound effects combine to create an unstable atmosphere that constantly keeps the player on edge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/ae0369d660f5a02fc7bd1a1dc4817127.poster.avif?t=1743152505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/ae0369d660f5a02fc7bd1a1dc4817127.webm?t=1743152505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/ae0369d660f5a02fc7bd1a1dc4817127.mp4?t=1743152505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/7792cc6709521b4d20cab7c641fde965.avif?t=1743152505\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132770/extras/d7eb3b2926deef0113537c798b6d2300.avif?t=1743152505\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt is strongly recommended to play with headphones to accurately gauge enemy positions and actions through sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed in Full HD. When played in fullscreen on a monitor with a resolution higher than Full HD, jagged edges (aliasing) may appear on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was created using Pixel Game Maker MV.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If the game does not start</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Installing the trial version of Pixel Game Maker MV on Steam may provide the necessary DLL files for your computer, allowing the game to run.</p>",
